The Crystal: code under the MIT licence (LICENSE), copyright Simon Gant.

- vendor/climb/ is The Climb (sjgant80-hub/the-climb), MIT, copyright Simon Gant: its kernels byte for byte at the
  commit that sealed them, recorded with their hashes in vendor/climb/PROVENANCE.json. Inside it, vendor/memory.mjs
  is the estate's twelve-chamber memory kernel and vendor/stats.mjs the exact McNemar test, as The Climb vendors them.
- data/seed.json is derived from The Climb's published sealed run (scripts/make-seed.mjs). The problems are made by
  code; nothing in them describes a real person or company.
- vendor/fonts/ holds Fraunces, Hanken Grotesk and JetBrains Mono (variable, latin), each under the SIL Open Font
  Licence 1.1; each folder carries its licence. They are served from this page so that no font host is called.
- The model is not part of this repository. The page fetches Llama 3.2 1B Instruct (Meta, Llama 3.2 Community Licence)
  from the MLC project's published build when the viewer presses the button, and runs it with WebLLM 0.2.79
  (Apache 2.0).
